# This file keeps the apps/ directory present in git so the per-hub cluster-apps
# Application (applicationsets/templates/hub/cluster-apps.yaml) always has a
# valid source path, even for hubs that have no drop-in apps yet.
#
# Drop-in apps live under apps/<hub>/. Each file is a raw ArgoCD manifest
# (typically an Application) applied verbatim to that hub. Subdirectories under
# apps/<hub>/ are for your own organization only -- nothing consumes their
# names; a manifest's own spec.destination is what routes it to a cluster.
